<title>USA: DII Group sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>DII Group sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NIWOT, Colo. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The D I I Group Inc on Tuesday said that it has declared a two-for-one stock split, effective September 2.</p>
<p>The split will be in the form of a stock dividend to holders of record as of August 15, 1997.</p>
<p>The stock split will increase the number of common shares outstanding to 24.8 million.</p>
<p>The D I I Group is an electronics design, engineering and manufacturing service provider.</p>
